{'symbol': 'LH', 'date': '2023-01-12 16:22:00', 'title': 'LABCORP DECLARES QUARTERLY DIVIDEND', 'text': 'BURLINGTON, N.C.--( BUSINESS WIRE )--LABCORP (NYSE: LH), A LEADING GLOBAL LIFE SCIENCES COMPANY, ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS HAS DECLARED A CASH DIVIDEND OF $0.72 PER SHARE OF COMMON STOCK. THE DIVIDEND WILL BE PAYABLE ON MARCH 13, 2023, TO STOCKHOLDERS OF RECORD AS OF THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON FEB. 23, 2023.'}